              a usual and a stress Story.
            - Every core test of ui-sdk's combobox (24), tree (69) and token input (29) maps to a Story test asserting
              the same behaviour, or is listed as dropped with its reason, in one mapping comment on this Task.
            - The three probable upstream bugs the proposal names are pinned as the correct behaviour.
            - The run rules and the reload sweep cover the new Stories; each new runtime rule has a planted fault that
              `nub run faults` catches, and a dead core fails every new test.
            - The package never imports, reads or names `codebases/`; `nub run check` and `nub run lint:rules` pass.
