               one admitted event's turns send") from a chain's depth, nor that sends made by an onContext turn count. A
               depth-only guard, or one that exempts a chain once context is in it, passes R11 to R13 and leaves a
               fan-out or an onContext-to-send loop unbounded. Missing: a fan-out past the guard in one admission
               refused, and a send from an onContext turn counted.
